{"unit_id":"sweet560__dsh-plugin-deepseek-chat#feature-retry","repo":"sweet560/dsh-plugin-deepseek-chat","commit":"2c97b7d5cc2ee2df3a4b31dcec920f388e975e41","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DeepSeek Chat 的功能「面板内故障重试」：webview 进程退出、被销毁或启动超时时，面板显示错误状态和重试按钮；点击后重新创建加载流程。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:399-403","lib/client.js:446-450","lib/client.js:495-504"]}
{"unit_id":"sweet560__dsh-plugin-deepseek-chat#caveat-session-login","repo":"sweet560/dsh-plugin-deepseek-chat","commit":"2c97b7d5cc2ee2df3a4b31dcec920f388e975e41","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DeepSeek Chat 直接在面板加载 chat.deepseek.com，首次使用需在站点登录；DSH 的内存浏览器分区会在应用退出后清除登录 cookie，因此重启后需重新登录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:38","lib/client.js:425-437","README.md:60-63"]}
